OL,3,GNEWSAMinimum wage rise 'a massive blow'
OL,4,Asays farmer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer has said the minimum wage
OL,7,Fincrease announced in the Budget would
OL,8,Fbe a "massive blow" for businesses like
OL,9,Fhis.
OL,11,FThe 3.9% rise was confirmed by
OL,12,FChancellor John Healey during his
OL,13,Fspeech in the House of Commons on
OL,14,FWednesday.
OL,16,FIt was among a raft of measures that he
OL,17,Fsaid were designed to help ease the
OL,18,Fpressures of the cost-of-living crisis
OL,19,Fby offering people "breathing space".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
