OL,3,GNEWSAMinimum wage rise 'a massive blow'
OL,4,Asays farmer
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Tristan Bennett, of Bennetts Farms
OL,7,Fin Worcester, said it seemed like "a
OL,8,Flot of tinkering and gimmicks" and that
OL,9,Fhe was "disappointed there was not
OL,10,Fanything substantial".
